  "title": "Chicken in Every Pot Pie",
  "description": "This hearty pie is baked in a 9x13-inch pan. Chicken and veggies are blended with cream of mushroom soup and chicken broth, topped with a biscuit crust, and then popped into the oven to bake until golden brown.",
  "authors": [
    "Debbie Rowe"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-07-22T23:27:11-04:00",
